{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在人物行为的因果解释和前后段落的自然衔接上不如Y，部分感受词也有堆叠、意象重复的问题。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、重点高亮和分时出现的感受词，更适合普通观众一边听音乐一边扫屏幕，能迅速抓住每段的情绪核心，也能感受到音乐变化中的细微层次。Y更擅长解释人物为什么这样想、为什么这样做，以及前后情节如何连接，但左侧长句更容易让观众进入阅读状态而不是聆听状态。综合实际观看场景，我选X，不过它需要借鉴Y更清楚的因果交代和叙事衔接。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8cbddd7d-e530-4b37-8192-487e75dab7c1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T220343623802Z", "elapsed_seconds": 61.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:04:44.933555+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d7cf03ce47c6f09a7127d6e54fc17d4d8b4bfb39df7e684a0d166915337a2822", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388